# Port of activemodel-8.1.3/lib/active_model.rb (the require list; partial: no Lint, no Railtie, no attributes/normalization)
#
# A model's class body (attr_accessor, attribute, validates, define_model_callbacks, ...) is a file of class
# bodies that `generate "rails/activemodel/active_model/generate/active_model", "FILE.rb"` turns into the class
# (its fields and includes) and its functions; see sakelib/notes/rails_activemodel.md.

